  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1 — Correctness patch. Retry-After honoring: server-requested backoff (e.g. 10 min) is no longer clobbered by the 5-min breaker default on the third failure — RecordFailure now only ever extends cooldown. Responses API on unknown hosts (LiteLLM, Azure custom domain, self-hosted gateway): shape router now detects `object==\"response\"` / `input_tokens_details` before falling to the Anthropic parser, so finish_reason and cache-token fields are set correctly instead of silently null. Request fingerprint is now gated to in-memory content types (StringContent, ByteArrayContent, JsonContent, BinaryContent, FormUrlEncodedContent) so `.GetAwaiter().GetResult()` inside a caller's DiagnosticSource can never deadlock a WPF/WinForms/legacy-ASP.NET SynchronizationContext. 1.0.0 — BREAKING: the SDK is now boring. Business data that changes on a SaaS release cadence (pricing tables, model → provider inference, model-id normalisation, cost estimation) has been REMOVED from the SDK. Deleted: TokensBillTools, ProviderParser.ProviderFromModel/NormalizeModelId, SdkCost. Backend serves the AI host allowlist via /api/config.",
